# Core Principles: Remake Waitlist App

## 1. Premium Aesthetic
- Primary Color (Pastel Pink): `#FFE6EC`
- Secondary/Background Color (Solid Dark): `#1C1C1C`
- The overall look and feel must convey a premium, high-quality experience.

## 2. Design Authenticity
- NO AI-slop or overused AI-generated artifacts.
- NO glassmorphism (avoid excessive blur and transparency overlays).
- 100% original design fidelity - implementations must strictly adhere to the original design specs.

## 3. Strict Mobile Resolutions
- The layout and design must be built specifically for strict mobile screen resolutions, ensuring a flawless mobile-first or mobile-only experience.
